      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "a. $v(t) = \\frac{dx(t)}{dt} = (3.0\\text{ m/s} - 6.0\\text{ m/s}^2t)$, $v(0.25\\text{ s}) = 1.50\\text{ m/s}$, $v(0.5\\text{ s}) = 0\\text{ m/s}$, $v(1.0\\text{ s}) = -3.0\\text{ m/s}$"
