    {
      "type": "figure",
      "text": "FIGURE 3.12 Racehorses accelerating out of the gate. (credit: modification of work by Jon Sullivan) — A photograph showing jockeys riding racehorses bursting out of starting gates at a racetrack.",
      "label": "FIGURE 3.12",
      "box": [423, 308, 620, 691]
