    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "5.2 Newton's First Law"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "LEARNING OBJECTIVES"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "By the end of this section, you will be able to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "text": "• Describe Newton's first law of motion\n• Recognize friction as an external force\n• Define inertia\n• Identify inertial reference frames\n• Calculate equilibrium for a system"
