      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CHECK YOUR UNDERSTANDING 5.9"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "One end of a 3.0-m rope is tied to a tree; the other end is tied to a car stuck in the mud. The motorist pulls sideways on the midpoint of the rope, displacing it a distance of 0.25 m. If he exerts a force of 200.0 N under these conditions, determine the force exerted on the car."
